<title>USA: Paul Harris Nov same-store sales up 26 pct.</title>
<headline>Paul Harris Nov same-store sales up 26 pct.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paul Harris Stores Inc said Tuesday its comparable store sales rose 26 percent in November from a year ago.  </p>
<p>Net sales in November 1996 increased to $21 million from $17.4 million in the previous year.</p>
<p>Year-to-date same-store sales were up 18 percent, with net sales rising to $142.7 million compared with $125.6 million for the same period in 1995, the women's specialty apparel retailer said.</p>
<p>Paul Harris shares rose 3/8 to 19-1/2 Tuesday.</p>
<p>	 ((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787)).</p>
